(SITE CONDITIONS) Tj T*
(- All equipment shall be suitable for operation at an ambient air temperature not) Tj T*
(exceeding 40 °C.) Tj T*
(- The equipment shall be suitable for relative humidity up to 95 per cent.) Tj T*
(- Site altitude does not exceed 1000 M above MSL.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SECTION 4: MAIN LT PANEL) Tj T*
(- Switchboards shall be designed, manufactured and tested in accordance with IS/IEC) Tj T*
(61439-1:2020 and IS/IEC 61439-2:2020. Panels shall be free standing, totally enclosed,) Tj T*
(made of 2 mm. thick CRCA sheet with powder coated finish.) Tj T*
(- The panel shall be suitable for 415 volts ± 10 per cent, 50 c/s, 3 phase 4 wire) Tj T*
(system.) Tj T*
(- The horizontal busbar shall be high conductivity aluminium alloy of 1600 A rating.) Tj T*
(- Short time withstand rating of the switchboard shall be 50 KA for 1 s.) Tj T*
(- Enclosure protection class for the switchboard shall be IP 54.) Tj T*
(- Internal separation of functional units shall be Form 4.) Tj T*
(- Incoming breaker shall be 1600 A four pole draw-out ACB as per IS/IEC 60947-2:2003) Tj T*
